# Possessor of a Precious Soul - 2 (Q242), middle part, on a level 60 Sorcerer subclass that has
# searched three angel corpses (cond 4): the fourth gives the Golden Hair for the Mysterious Dark
# Knight; Kalis wants Matild's sorcery ingredient (a hand-in bypass her last page does not offer
# is refused); a Restrainer of Glory leaves an Orb of Binding, which binds the first cornerstone
# (a use bypass before that is refused), and the cornerstone leaves the world; then relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
